,000\n   50 \u00d7 10 = 500\n   50 \u00d7 8 = 400\n   1 \u00d7 300 = 300\n   1 \u00d7 10 = 10\n   1 \u00d7 8 = 8\n\n5. Add all the products together:\n   180,000 + 6,000 + 4,800 + 15,000 + 500 + 400 + 300 + 10 + 8 = 206,418\n\nTherefore, the product of 651 and 318 using the distributive property is 206,418.\n</answer>",
